nvidia-container-toolkit (1.19.1-1deepin1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Limit supported architectures to amd64 and arm64
  * Set GOTOOLCHAIN=local to prevent automatic toolchain download
  * Add debian/patches/downgrade-go-version.patch to downgrade go
    version requirements from 1.25.0 to 1.22 for build environment
    compatibility
  * Add debian/patches/fix-go-122-compatibility.patch to replace
    Go 1.23+ APIs (os.OpenRoot, strings.SplitSeq, bytes.SplitSeq)
    with Go 1.22 compatible equivalents

